# Supply-chain defaults. See docs/DEPENDENCY_POLICY.md.

# `npm install <pkg>` writes an exact version rather than a caret range, so
# every dependency change is a visible, reviewable edit instead of a range that
# silently picks up whatever was published since.
#
# What actually pins the transitive tree is the committed package-lock.json
# plus `npm ci` in CI; this setting only keeps new direct dependencies from
# reintroducing ranges.
save-exact=true
